#     0.254.0.0 set in cc3501e-release-0.254.0.0.  Both are rollbacks on it now.
#   - 0.254.2.0 and 0.254.3.0 are ALSO rollbacks on it now -- each intermediate
#     flash is spent the moment the next one lands.
#   - any future image for it must be STRICTLY ABOVE 0.254.9.0.  A stamp chosen
#     between 0.254.2.0 and 0.254.9.0 looks new against an older log entry and
